mic Vinaigrette (light)\",\"amount\":\"2 tbsp\",\"calories\":60}],\"totalCalories\":512,\"macros\":{\"protein\":37,\"carbs\":50,\"fat\":19},\"instructions\":[\"Grill or pan-fry chicken breast until cooked through. Slice into strips.\",\"Combine cooked quinoa, mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, and cucumber in a large bowl.\",\"Top with sliced grilled chicken. Drizzle with light balsamic vinaigrette and toss gently.\"]},\"dinner\":{\"name\":\"Lean Pork & Vegetable Stir-fry with Brown Rice\",\"time\":\"7:00 PM\",\"description\":\"A flavorful Vietnamese-inspired stir-fry, rich in vegetables and lean protein.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Lean Pork Loin, thinly sliced\",\"amount\":\"120g\",\"calories\":180},{\"name\":\"Broccoli Florets\",\"amount\":\"1 cup\",\"calories\":55},{\"name\":\"Carrots, sliced\",\"amount\":\"1/2 cup\",\"calories\":25},{\"name\":\"Bell Pepper, sliced\",\"amount\":\"1/2 cup\",\"calories\":15},{\"name\":\"Onion, chopped\",\"amount\":\"1/4 cup\",\"calories\":10},{\"name\":\"Soy Sauce (low sodium)\",\"amount\":\"1 tbsp\",\"calories\":8},{\"name\":\"Ginger, grated\",\"amount\":\"1 tsp\",\"calories\":5},{\"name\":\"Garlic, minced\",\"amount\":\"1 tsp\",\"calories\":5},{\"name\":\"Sesame Oil\",\"amount\":\"1 tsp\",\"calories\":40},{\"name\":\"Cooked Brown Rice\",\"amount\":\"1 cup\",\"calories\":215}],\"totalCalories\":578,\"macros\":{\"protein\":34,\"carbs\":70,\"fat\":19},\"instructions\":[\"Heat sesame oil in a large wok or skillet over medium-high heat.\",\"Add minced garlic and grated ginger, stir-fry for 30 seconds until fragrant.\",\"Add sliced pork loin and stir-fry until browned and cooked through, about 5-7 minutes. Remove pork and set aside.\",\"Add broccoli, carrots, bell pepper, and onion to the wok. Stir-fry for 5-7 minutes until vegetables are tender-crisp.\",\"Return pork to the wok. Add low sodium soy sauce and stir to combine.\",\"Serve immediately with a side of cooked brown rice.\"]},\"snack\":{\"name\":\"Greek Yogurt with Mixed Berries & Almonds\",\"time\":\"3:30 PM\",\"description\":\"A refreshing and protein-packed snack to curb cravings and support muscle recovery.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Plain Greek Yogurt (0% fat)\",\"amount\":\"1 cup (220g)\",\"calories\":130},{\"name\":\"Mixed Berries (fresh or frozen)\",\"amount\":\"1/2 cup\",\"calories\":40},{\"name\":\"Slivered Almonds\",\"amount\":\"1 tbsp\",\"calories\":45}],\"totalCalories\":215,\"macros\":{\"protein\":23,\"carbs\":18,\"fat\":5},\"instructions\":[\"Combine Greek yogurt, mixed berries, and slivered almonds in a bowl.\"]}},\"dailyTotals\":{\"calories\":1733,\"protein\":117,\"carbs\":162,\"fat\":70}},{\"dayNumber\":2,\"date\":\"Day 2\",\"meals\":{\"breakfast\":{\"name\":\"Overnight Oats with Protein Powder\",\"time\":\"7:00 AM\",\"description\":\"A convenient and nutritious breakfast, prepared the night before.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Rolled Oats\",\"amount\":\"1/2 cup\",\"calories\":150},{\"name\":\"Unsweetened Almond Milk\",\"amount\":\"1 cup\",\"calories\":30},{\"name\":\"Vanilla Whey Protein Powder\",\"amount\":\"1 scoop (30g)\",\"calories\":120},{\"name\":\"Chia Seeds\",\"amount\":\"1 tbsp\",\"calories\":60},{\"name\":\"Banana, sliced\",\"amount\":\"1/2 medium\",\"calories\":50}],\"totalCalories\":410,\"macros\":{\"protein\":27,\"carbs\":55,\"fat\":10},\"instructions\":[\"The night before: In a jar or container, combine oats, almond milk, protein powder, and chia seeds. Stir well.\",\"Cover and refrigerate overnight.\",\"In the morning, top with sliced banana and enjoy.\"]},\"lunch\":{\"name\":\"Vietnamese Chicken & Vermicelli Salad (Bún Gà Nướng, lighter version)\",\"time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"description\":\"A fresh and flavorful Vietnamese salad, focusing on lean protein and fresh herbs.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Grilled Chicken Breast, sliced\",\"amount\":\"120g\",\"calories\":198},{\"name\":\"Vermicelli Noodles (cooked)\",\"amount\":\"100g\",\"calories\":110},{\"name\":\"Mixed Greens/Lettuce\",\"amount\":\"1 cup\",\"calories\":5},{\"na