 eggs to your preference.\",\"Top avocado toast with eggs and halved cherry tomatoes. Season with salt and pepper.\"]},\"lunch\":{\"name\":\"Lentil Soup with Whole-Wheat Roll\",\"time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"description\":\"A warm, comforting, and high-fiber vegetarian soup, perfect for a satisfying lunch.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Lentil Soup (homemade: lentils, carrots, celery, onion, vegetable broth)\",\"amount\":\"400g\",\"calories\":350},{\"name\":\"Whole-Wheat Dinner Roll\",\"amount\":\"1\",\"calories\":120}],\"totalCalories\":470,\"macros\":{\"protein\":24,\"carbs\":70,\"fat\":8},\"instructions\":[\"Prepare a batch of lentil soup (can be meal prepped). Sauté chopped carrots, celery, and onion. Add lentils, vegetable broth, and desired spices. Simmer until lentils are tender.\",\"Serve a portion of lentil soup with a whole-wheat dinner roll.\"]},\"dinner\":{\"name\":\"Grilled Chicken Breast with Roasted Sweet Potato & Broccoli\",\"time\":\"7:00 PM\",\"description\":\"A classic fitness meal: lean protein, complex carbs, and green vegetables.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Chicken Breast (grilled)\",\"amount\":\"180g\",\"calories\":297},{\"name\":\"Sweet Potato (roasted)\",\"amount\":\"200g\",\"calories\":172},{\"name\":\"Broccoli Florets (roasted)\",\"amount\":\"150g\",\"calories\":52},{\"name\":\"Olive Oil (for roasting)\",\"amount\":\"1.5 tsp\",\"calories\":60}],\"totalCalories\":581,\"macros\":{\"protein\":55,\"carbs\":48,\"fat\":16},\"instructions\":[\"Preheat oven to 200°C (400°F). Cut sweet potato into cubes and broccoli into florets. Toss with olive oil, salt, and pepper. Roast for 25-30 minutes, or until tender and slightly caramelized.\",\"Grill chicken breast until cooked through.\",\"Serve grilled chicken with roasted sweet potato and broccoli.\"]},\"snack\":{\"name\":\"Greek Yogurt with Berries & Walnuts\",\"time\":\"3:00 PM\",\"description\":\"A creamy, protein-packed snack with antioxidants and healthy fats.\",\"foods\":[{\"name\":\"Greek Yogurt (plain, 0% fat)