each stretch for 60 seconds, breathing deeply and relaxing into it.\"}]',40,135,'Warm up for 5 minutes with light cardio and dynamic arm stretches. Cool down for 5 minutes with comprehensive static stretches, focusing on all major muscle groups.',0,0,NULL,'2025-12-06 13:26:37','2025-12-06 13:26:37'),(335,13,27,'Week 4, Day 6 - Rest Day','Recovery','[]',0,0,NULL,1,0,NULL,'2025-12-06 13:26:37','2025-12-06 13:26:37'),(336,13,28,'Week 4, Day 7 - Rest Day','Recovery','[]',0,0,NULL,1,0,NULL,'2025-12-06 13:26:37','2025-12-06 13:26:37');
